 "description": "Step-by-step maintenance guides \u2014 tools, supplies, steps and warnings, in our own words with the maker's documents as sources. With no arguments, every guide for the user's current grinders and machines (and the water filter fitted in each). With guide_ids, those guides; the ids come from maintenance.tasks[].guide.id in list_grinders and list_machines. Ids that match no guide are listed under missing.",
